    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Story\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were working as a contract employee for a major general company when suddenly one day you are told that your contract is terminated due to the company's reasons.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, you have to move out of the apartment you are living in.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have lost your job and your house at same time.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are at a loss as to what to do next, when your childhood friends, Haru and Minami, appear.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two men, who are willing to help you, suddenly propose &quot;marriage.&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, there is a condition to the marriage...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haru is mean but sometimes kind, and Minami is a gentleman and a prince.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a tight spot. Which proposal will you accept?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what is the future for you and him...?!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will fall in love with him at the mercy of these two sadistic men.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u202f\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Characters\u202f\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aoyama Haru (VA:Hayato Dojima)\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selfish and a bit pushy but unexpectedly shows his kindness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot and cold childhood friend.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saotome Minami (VA:Yuto Suzuki)\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kind and sincere to everyone and is like a prince.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there is a side to him that he doesn't show to anyone but you...?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Key Feature\u202f\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbVisual Novel about a sweet and slightly dangerous romance between two childhood friends\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStory splits based on player's choices\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFull voice recorded by great voice actors (for some parts)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRead the thrill of love with love scenarios with voice\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u202f\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Estimated Playing Time\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 5-7 hours\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u202f\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Languages\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese, English, Chinese (Traditional)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bAll voices are in Japanese\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Story\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were working as a contract employee for a major general company when suddenly one day you are told that your contract is terminated due to the company's reasons.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, you have to move out of the apartment you are living in.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have lost your job and your house at same time.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are at a loss as to what to do next, when your childhood friends, Haru and Minami, appear.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two men, who are willing to help you, suddenly propose &quot;marriage.&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, there is a condition to the marriage...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haru is mean but sometimes kind, and Minami is a gentleman and a prince.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a tight spot. Which proposal will you accept?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what is the future for you and him...?!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will fall in love with him at the mercy of these two sadistic men.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u202f\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Characters\u202f\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aoyama Haru (VA:Hayato Dojima)\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selfish and a bit pushy but unexpectedly shows his kindness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot and cold childhood friend.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saotome Minami (VA:Yuto Suzuki)\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kind and sincere to everyone and is like a prince.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there is a side to him that he doesn't show to anyone but you...?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Key Feature\u202f\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbVisual Novel about a sweet and slightly dangerous romance between two childhood friends\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStory splits based on player's choices\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFull voice recorded by great voice actors (for some parts)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRead the thrill of love with love scenarios with voice\u202f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u202f\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Estimated Playing Time\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 5-7 hours\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u202f\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Languages\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese, English, Chinese (Traditional)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bAll voices are in Japanese\u00a0</p>",
